# The walkers on four legs (R4): in ANDAR, stepped back to the reception's door, the busy fixture
# sends the postman (and then api-gateway) to you; the first shot catches the postman mid-stride
# (rig::cat_walking, the stride from the distance walked), the second once they sit before you.
key w
expect mode ANDAR
down s
wait 1200
up s
wait 200
inject cats {"fixture":"busy"}
wait 2000
shot ${OUT}/shot-cats-walk.png
dump ${OUT}/dump-cats-walk.json
wait 4000
shot ${OUT}/shot-cats-walk-arrived.png
quit
